Purge cap for /mnt/UDISK/printer_data/config/box.cfg on the printer.
Apply by hand (this is not a git-applyable diff). See docs/TEST_PLAN.md.

--- box.cfg (stock, [box] section)
+++ box.cfg (proposed)
@@ [box]
 buffer_empty_len: 30
+# Caps the stock extrusion_all_materials purge ("extrude more than %d").
+# Stock default is 3000. Measure the CFS-to-toolhead tube and set to that
+# length plus about 300 mm.
+max_tube_length: 2000

cfg-guardian entry (patches.json "changes" array), only if the guardian
supports adding a new key; otherwise add the line by hand:
    {
      "file": "box.cfg",
      "section": "[box]",
      "description": "Cap the CFS empty-slot purge below the 3000 mm stock default",
      "setting": "max_tube_length",
      "from": null,
      "to": "2000",
      "enabled": true
    }
